OL,3,AUK could 'unlock' 100 more oil and gas
OL,4,Aprojects, say North Sea bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK could supply half of its oil and
OL,7,Fgas needs without imports if the
OL,8,Fgovernment showed more support for the
OL,9,Fsector, an industry report claims.
OL,11,FOffshore Energies UK (OEUK) said
OL,12,Fchanges to the windfall tax on energy
OL,13,Ffirms and approval of the controversial
OL,14,FRosebank and Jackdaw fields could
OL,15,Funlock 111 projects, attracting
OL,16,Finvestment worth #50bn.
OL,18,FNorth Sea output has been falling and
OL,19,Fprojections suggest that the UK's
OL,20,Fdomestic supplies will meet only about
OL,21,Fa third of demand until 2050.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
