OL,3,AUK could 'unlock' 100 more oil and gas
OL,4,Aprojects, say North Sea bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironmental group Uplift branded the
OL,7,Freport a "fantasy" and said that the
OL,8,FPrime Minister should not listen to
OL,9,F"self-interested demands" of oil
OL,10,Fcompanies.
